@startuml selma_artifact_lifecycle
' ============================================================
' Selma — Artifact Lifecycle State Machine
' Source:  SPECIFICATION.md §2.1 (execution artifacts), §2.6, §3.5, §3.6
' C4:      Snapshots Adapter → artifact_store → audit_platform
'          Compiled Rules Adapter → cgir_store (CG-IR snapshots)
'          Findings & Audit Trail Adapter → event_store (events)
' Contract: 8.2.4
'
' Models write-once / append-only retention for:
'   · CG-IR snapshots
'   · Inspection snapshots + pipeline traces
'   · Conflict artifacts
'   · Certification artifacts
'   · Finding events (append-only stream entries)
' ============================================================

title Selma — Artifact Lifecycle FSM\n<size:12><i>Immutable creation · append-only retention · audit replication · no silent rewrite</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

[*] --> Building : producer begins materialization

state "Building" as Building #B9770E : transient workspace\n**not** durable truth yet
state "Validated" as Validated #1B7A6E : integrity checks OK\nhashes computed
state "Published" as Published #2C6E49 : content-addressed\nor write-once committed
state "Active\nReference" as ActiveReference #3B7DD8 : referenced by inspections\nor human workflows
state "Superseded\nReference" as SupersededReference #4A4A4A : newer snapshot supersedes\nfor *selection*; old remains
state "Archived" as Archived #4A4A4A : long-term retention
state "Replicated" as Replicated #2C6E49 : audit_platform copy
state "Rejected\nBuild" as RejectedBuild #A93226 : validation failed\n**no durable artifact**

Building --> Validated : integrity OK
Building --> RejectedBuild : integrity FAIL
RejectedBuild --> [*]

Validated --> Published : CAS put / object write-once

Published --> ActiveReference : first consumer pin
Published --> Replicated : async audit replicate
ActiveReference --> SupersededReference : newer CG-IR / new inspect
ActiveReference --> Replicated
SupersededReference --> Archived : retention policy
Replicated --> Archived : retention complete path
Archived --> [*]

note right of Published
  **Immutability rules**
  · No in-place update of content
  · No delete of CG-IR or finding events
  · Inspection snapshots never modified
    after completion (§2.13)
  · Reinspect / recompile create **new**
    artifacts under new IDs/hashes

  **Artifact types under this lifecycle**
  · CG-IR Snapshot — hash identity; indefinite
  · Inspection Snapshot — default retain 7y
  · Pipeline Trace — default retain 1y
  · Conflict Artifact — pending → archived
  · Certification Artifact — AA gate report
  · Finding Event — append-only HLC stream
end note

note left of Building
  **Producers (C4)**
  · Hermetic Compiler → CG-IR
  · Rule Inspector → inspection snapshot + trace
  · Conflict Resolver → conflict artifact
  · Architectural Auditor → certification artifact
  · Lifecycle Finder → finding events
end note

note bottom of Archived
  **Retention (§3.5)**
  CG-IR snapshots / node objects: indefinite
  Finding events: indefinite
  Inspection snapshots: configurable (default 7y)
  Pipeline traces: configurable (default 1y)
  Replication to audit_platform is append-only async.
  Concurrency: content-addressed put is idempotent;
  concurrent identical publishes converge on same hash.
end note

@enduml
